  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The cross aldol reaction takes place between isobutyraldehyde and formaldehyde&nbsp;to&nbsp;get hydroxypivaldehyde. On reaction with hydrogen cyanide&nbsp;followed by hydrolysis produces the lactone product.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/048c981b-734c-466b-af6f-d4fa7f8efab3-9893508_5.PNG\" style=\"width: 497px; height: 242px;\" /></p>",
